      "title": "Office of the Dean of the Faculty",
      "description": "Our History and Past Deans | Office of the Dean of the Faculty Office of the Dean of the Faculty Off screen link: Skip to content Off screen link: Skip to search Main Menu Menu About , (current section) About Submenu About Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans , (current page) Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Submenu Professorships Preceptorships Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Governance Governance Submenu Governance Rules & Procedures Policy Resources Memos Faculty Committees Faculty Committees Submenu Faculty Committee Elections University Faculty Service Recognition Faculty Meetings Faculty Meetings Submenu Faculty Meeting Voting Instructions Faculty Referenda Board of Trustees Reporting Terms & Definitions Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Development and Inclusion Submenu Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Search Process Talent Pathway Programs Talent Pathway Programs Submenu Presidential Postdoctoral Research Fellows Faculty Diversity Salons Faculty Faculty Submenu Faculty Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Compensation Submenu Faculty Pay Schedule Elections Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Retirement Submenu Retirement Eligibility Top Five Retirement Questions Retirement Planning Process Faculty Retirement Plans Benefits in Retirement Faculty Forms Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Committee Nomination Form Faculty Leave Request Form Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Academic Professionals Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Home About Section Menu Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans , (current page) Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Our History and Past Deans Dean of the Faculty , the University's oldest and highest-ranking deanship, was established by the trustees in 1883. The trustees charged the dean of the faculty \"with over­sight of whatever does not pertain directly to the work of instruction, such in particular as the discipline of the College, the assignment of rooms and the sanitary condition of the Institution.\" As thus de­fined, this continued to be the dean of the faculty's function until 1909 when, with the creation of the Office of the Dean of the College, these duties were assigned to the new dean, and the dean of the faculty took over from the president oversight of the application and enforcement of rules and standards of scholarship in the University. The dean of the faculty also chaired, ex-officio, the faculty committee on examinations and standing, and was responsible for discharging the general duties of the president in his absence or disability. During the post-World War II years, as the dean of the college assumed increasing responsibility for the academic life of undergraduates, the dean of the faculty took increasing responsibility for the oversight of the departments of instruction and concern for the well-being of the faculty. In 1967, the newly created Office of the Provost took over the responsibility of acting for the president in his or her absence or disability. Today the dean of the faculty has administrative oversight of the academic departments, centers and programs, and of all matters that pertain to the effectiveness and well-being of the faculty, and of the professional librarians, researchers and specialists. There have been 17 deans of the faculty to date. The current dean is Gene A. Jarrett. Please click on each individual portrait to learn more about our deans. — History adapted from The New Princeton Companion, by Robert K. Durkee. Gene A. Jarrett 2021 - Sanjeev R. Kulkarni 2017 - 2021 Deborah A. Prentice 2014 - 2017 David P. Dobkin 2003 - 2014 Joseph H. Taylor 1997 - 2003 Amy Gutmann 1995 - 1997 Robert C. Gunning 1989 - 1995 Aaron Lemonick 1973 - 1989 Richard Allen Lester 1968 - 1973 Robert Roswell Palmer 1967 - 1968 James Douglas Brown 1946 - 1967 Robert Kilburn Root 1933 - 1946 Luther Pfahler Eisenhart 1925 - 1933 William Francis Magie 1912 - 1925 Henry Burchard Fine 1903 - 1912 Samuel Ross Winans 1899 - 1903 James Ormsbee Murray 1883 – 1899 Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
