    "http://dof.princeton.edu/faculty": {
      "title": "Office of the Dean of the Faculty",
      "description": "Resources for Faculty | Office of the Dean of the Faculty Office of the Dean of the Faculty Off screen link: Skip to content Off screen link: Skip to search Main Menu Menu About About Submenu About Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Submenu Professorships Preceptorships Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Governance Governance Submenu Governance Rules & Procedures Policy Resources Memos Faculty Committees Faculty Committees Submenu Faculty Committee Elections University Faculty Service Recognition Faculty Meetings Faculty Meetings Submenu Faculty Meeting Voting Instructions Faculty Referenda Board of Trustees Reporting Terms & Definitions Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Development and Inclusion Submenu Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Search Process Talent Pathway Programs Talent Pathway Programs Submenu Presidential Postdoctoral Research Fellows Faculty Diversity Salons Faculty , (current page) Faculty Submenu Faculty Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Compensation Submenu Faculty Pay Schedule Elections Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Retirement Submenu Retirement Eligibility Top Five Retirement Questions Retirement Planning Process Faculty Retirement Plans Benefits in Retirement Faculty Forms Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Committee Nomination Form Faculty Leave Request Form Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Academic Professionals Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Resources for Faculty United by an unwavering commitment to world-class teaching and research, Princeton University’s visionary faculty define the leading edge of their fields. Every day, Princeton University scholars make groundbreaking contributions across disciplines while cultivating innovative classroom experiences that inspire the next generation of thinkers. In turn, the University is committed to providing transformative resources of benefit to your life and scholarly career. As members of a global community that operates on a first-name basis, the Office of the Dean of the Faculty is here to offer clear guidance, informed insight and unwavering support as you pursue insights with the capacity to change what’s possible. Incoming Faculty Complete the onboarding process and connect with the wealth of resources available to you. Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Review the advancement process for tenured- and tenure-track faculty and non-tenure-track faculty. Faculty Benefits Achieve your personal and professional goals with an array of benefits for both you and your family. Compensation Find guidance to help you manage compensation-related matters, including pay schedule elections. Learning & Professional Development Opportunities for faculty members and academic professionals. Faculty Retirement Plan for this milestone event with details on Princeton’s competitive retirement plans. Apply for an Academic Job Echoing Princeton’s informal yet transformative motto, we contextualize our work in the pursuit of a greater purpose. As such, we actively seek and retain faculty of exceptional ability who bring diverse perspectives and experiences to campus, sharing in our commitment to excellence in teaching and scholarship. Apply to Join Us Link is external Faculty Highlights Link is external David MacMillan Awarded the 2027 Arthur C. Cope Award Link is external Sept. 8, 2026 David MacMillan , the James S. McDonnell Distinguished University Professor of Chemistry, has been awarded the prestigious 2027 Arthur C. Cope Award by the American Chemical Society (ACS) in recognition of extraordinary achievement and contributions to the field of catalysis. Link is external Paul Chirik Recipient of ACS Award in Organometallic Chemistry Link is external Sept. 2, 2026 Paul Chirik , the Edwards S. Sanford Professor of Chemistry, has been named the recipient of the 2027 American Chemical Society (ACS) Award in Organometallic Chemistry. This year’s national awardees, selected for outstanding achievements in chemistry, were announced this week by the ACS. Link is external Bonnie Bassler receives top Royal Society honor for seminal research in quorum sensing Link is external Aug. 27, 2026 Bassler has been named the 2026 recipient of the society's Copley Medal, its oldest and most prestigious prize. Upcoming Faculty Meetings Sep 14 Faculty Meeting Sep 23 Faculty Meeting Materials Deadline Oct 5 Faculty Meeting View All Faculty Meetings Rules & Procedures Rules and Procedures of the Faculty of Princeton University Policies Equal Opportunity Non-Discrimination Statement Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
