Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Home Resources for Faculty Section Menu Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits , (current page) Compensation Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Forms Faculty Benefits Expansive benefits packages ignite new possibilities in your scholarly work and in your life outside of Princeton. In all that we do, we make it a point to promote the excellence and wellbeing of our world-class faculty. Take time to explore the benefits that are available to you–from funding to programs specifically designed for families. Should you have questions, the Office of the Dean of the Faculty can help you navigate Princeton’s vast network of resources both within our office and beyond. University-Wide Benefits Visit Human Resources for a Benefits Eligibility Tool Link is external that provides detailed information about benefits based on classification, duty time, and/or visa status. Be sure to review the collection of benefits designed for families Link is external . Link is external Health Link is external Benefits-eligible employees enjoy comprehensive yet flexible health insurance plans and competitive dental, vision, and prescription drug plans that address individual needs. Link is external Wellness Link is external Princeton takes an expansive view of wellness, from physical and mental health to financial planning and tools that facilitate work-life balance for you and your family. Link is external Retirement & Financial Link is external Plan for your future and make the most of today with competitive retirement plans, flexible spending accounts, tuition assistance, income protection, financial planning help and more. Additional Benefits The Office of the Dean of the Faculty is proud to offer benefits specifically designed to meet the needs of our faculty members. Thoughtfully created to specifically address topics like funding and leaves, they complement those provided by HR. View Faculty Benefits Family Friendly Benefits Princeton takes pride in being a family friendly University and offers a wide range of benefits to help you balance your family life and scholarship as a Princeton University faculty member. View Family-Friendly Benefits Faculty Leaves Princeton offers generous policies that allow faculty to be relieved periodically from normal teaching and other duties in order to pursue scholarship. View Leaves for Scholarship VIEW PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT LEAVES Useful Resources Services & Resources Link is external Human Resources Link is external HR Self-Service Link is external Policies Business Expenses Childbirth & Parenting Leaves Learned Society Travel Fund Workload Relief for New Parents Accommodations and/or Support for Individuals with Disabilities or Otherwise at a High Risk for Serious Illness Relating to COVID-19 Compensation & Duty Assignment Summer Employment Outside Professional Activities Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
