      "title": "Office of the Dean of the Faculty",
      "description": "Faculty Committee Nomination Form | Office of the Dean of the Faculty Office of the Dean of the Faculty Off screen link: Skip to content Off screen link: Skip to search Main Menu Menu About About Submenu About Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Submenu Professorships Preceptorships Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Governance Governance Submenu Governance Rules & Procedures Policy Resources Memos Faculty Committees Faculty Committees Submenu Faculty Committee Elections University Faculty Service Recognition Faculty Meetings Faculty Meetings Submenu Faculty Meeting Voting Instructions Faculty Referenda Board of Trustees Reporting Terms & Definitions Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Development and Inclusion Submenu Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Search Process Talent Pathway Programs Talent Pathway Programs Submenu Presidential Postdoctoral Research Fellows Faculty Diversity Salons Faculty , (current section) Faculty Submenu Faculty Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Compensation Submenu Faculty Pay Schedule Elections Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Retirement Submenu Retirement Eligibility Top Five Retirement Questions Retirement Planning Process Faculty Retirement Plans Benefits in Retirement Faculty Forms , (current section) Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Committee Nomination Form , (current page) Faculty Leave Request Form Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Academic Professionals Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Home Resources for Faculty Faculty Forms Section Menu Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Forms , (current section) Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Forms Faculty Committee Nomination Form , (current page) Faculty Leave Request Form Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Faculty Committee Nomination Form We encourage our faculty members to take an active part in the governance of the University by serving on its faculty committees. Please indicate below on which committees you would be willing to serve or nominate another faculty member for service. Information about each committee can be found in the Rules and Procedures of the Faculty . The clerk of the faculty will share this information with the Committee on Committees . You may also complete and print this form and mail it to the Clerk of the Faculty, 201 Stanhope Hall. Use the nomination form below to send your recommendation to the Office of the Dean of the Faculty. A complete list of University-wide faculty committees, their composition, length of term, and duties can be found in Rules and Procedures of the Faculty ( Chapter II, section D ). Faculty Committee Nomination Form Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
