    "http://dof.princeton.edu/faculty/faculty-forms/faculty-leave-request-form": {
      "title": "Office of the Dean of the Faculty",
      "description": "Faculty Leave Request Form | Office of the Dean of the Faculty Office of the Dean of the Faculty Off screen link: Skip to content Off screen link: Skip to search Main Menu Menu About About Submenu About Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Submenu Professorships Preceptorships Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Governance Governance Submenu Governance Rules & Procedures Policy Resources Memos Faculty Committees Faculty Committees Submenu Faculty Committee Elections University Faculty Service Recognition Faculty Meetings Faculty Meetings Submenu Faculty Meeting Voting Instructions Faculty Referenda Board of Trustees Reporting Terms & Definitions Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Development and Inclusion Submenu Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Search Process Talent Pathway Programs Talent Pathway Programs Submenu Presidential Postdoctoral Research Fellows Faculty Diversity Salons Faculty , (current section) Faculty Submenu Faculty Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Compensation Submenu Faculty Pay Schedule Elections Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Retirement Submenu Retirement Eligibility Top Five Retirement Questions Retirement Planning Process Faculty Retirement Plans Benefits in Retirement Faculty Forms , (current section) Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Committee Nomination Form Faculty Leave Request Form , (current page) Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Academic Professionals Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Home Resources for Faculty Faculty Forms Section Menu Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Forms , (current section) Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Forms Faculty Committee Nomination Form Faculty Leave Request Form , (current page) Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Faculty Leave Request Form Access the Faculty Leave Request Form Log into your HR Self-Service Link is external . Change the landing page from \"Teaching and Advising\" to \"HR Self Service\" using the drop-down at the top center of the page. Click the \"Faculty Leaves\" tile. On the “Leave Request” screen, you will see: An orange “Request a Faculty Leave” button, A listing of your prior leave requests through this new system, and A summary of your leave history. Click on “Request a Faculty Leave” to begin the leave request process. Request a Faculty Leave On the “Faculty Leave Request” page, begin by selecting the Academic Year of the requested leave from the drop-down menu. Select the term of the leave: If you are requesting an entire academic year leave and the leave type will be the same for the entire period, select “ Academic Year – One Leave Type ”. Then select the leave type and pay type from the drop-down menus. If you are requesting an entire academic year leave and the leave type for the fall will differ from the leave type for the spring, select “ Academic Year – Varying Leave Types by Term ”.  By selecting this option, you are now able to select the leave type and pay type for both the fall and the spring terms from the drop-down menus. If you are requesting a leave for the fall term only, select “ Fall Term Only .” Then select the leave type and pay type from the drop-down menus. If you are requesting a leave for the spring term only, select “ Spring Term Only .” Then select the leave type and pay type from the drop-down menus. If you will be out of the country at any time as part of your leave, please enter the name(s) of the country or countries and the start and end dates for your time abroad. If you are unsure about dates, please estimate. Separate trips to the same country should be listed. Upload your Leave Statement by clicking on the “Attach Faculty Member’s Statement” and selecting the file using the “Browse” button.  We encourage you to use this template Link downloads document for your Leave Statement. Please note that the system will only accept PDF files, so you will need to convert your completed Faculty Member's Statement to a PDF file before uploading. Upload any supporting documents, as PDF files, by clicking on the “Attach Other Supporting Doc” button. Use the “Additional Comments” box to communicate any additional information to your department manager and chair. Please note that in the process of considering or requesting a leave of absence, a faculty member should take into account the obligations associated with his/her current and pending sponsored programs at Princeton. The department grants manager and/or ORPA is available to assist with this. Depending on the circumstances, sponsors may require notification of the leave or a replacement PI may need to temporary be named. Click “Submit to Department” to send your completed leave request to your department for further review. If you would like to save your request without sending it to your department, click “Save & Finish Later”. Review, Revise, or Cancel a Previously Submitted Leave Log into your HR Self-Service Link is external . Change the landing page from \"Teaching and Advising\" to \"HR Self Service\" using the drop-down at the top center of the page. To review or cancel the leave request, select “Click to Review Leave” next to each leave request in the \"Leave Request History\" box.  You can select “Revise Request” or “Cancel Request” on the right side of the screen.  You may also view previously uploaded attachments by selecting the “View Attachment” button. Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
    },
    "http://dof.princeton.edu/academic-professionals/academic-professional-career-ranks-advancement": {
      "title": "Office of the Dean of the Faculty",
      "description": "Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement | Office of the Dean of the Faculty Office of the Dean of the Faculty Off screen link: Skip to content Off screen link: Skip to search Main Menu Menu About About Submenu About Dean's Welcome Meet Our Team Whom to Contact Facts & Figures Our History and Past Deans Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Endowed Professorships, Preceptorships & Fellowships Submenu Professorships Preceptorships Fellowships Emeriti Faculty Bios President's Award for Distinguished Teaching Visiting Professorships for Distinguished Teaching Howard T. Behrman Award for Distinguished Achievement in the Humanities Meet The Faculty Public Lectures Link is external Governance Governance Submenu Governance Rules & Procedures Policy Resources Memos Faculty Committees Faculty Committees Submenu Faculty Committee Elections University Faculty Service Recognition Faculty Meetings Faculty Meetings Submenu Faculty Meeting Voting Instructions Faculty Referenda Board of Trustees Reporting Terms & Definitions Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Development and Inclusion Submenu Faculty Development and Inclusion Faculty Search Process Talent Pathway Programs Talent Pathway Programs Submenu Presidential Postdoctoral Research Fellows Faculty Diversity Salons Faculty Faculty Submenu Faculty Incoming Faculty Faculty Ranks, Appointment & Advancement Faculty Benefits Compensation Compensation Submenu Faculty Pay Schedule Elections Learning & Professional Development Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Faculty Retirement Faculty Retirement Submenu Retirement Eligibility Top Five Retirement Questions Retirement Planning Process Faculty Retirement Plans Benefits in Retirement Faculty Forms Faculty Forms Submenu Faculty Committee Nomination Form Faculty Leave Request Form Moving Expense Form Request Research Assistance (UCHRSS) Update Personal Information Nepotism Policy Disclosure Form Academic Professionals , (current section) Academic Professionals Submenu Academic Professionals Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement , (current page) Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Visitors Visitors Submenu Visitors Incoming Visitors Visitor Ranks & Appointments Visitor Benefits Academic Units Academic Units Submenu Academic Units Directory of Academic Units, Chairs, Directors & Managers Guidebook for Chairs, Directors and Managers Guidelines for Academic Reviews Systems Guide & How-To’s Systems Guide & How-To’s Submenu Interfolio Faculty Search Authorization Request Guide AHIRE Guide DOF DropBox Instructions Salary Commitment Guidelines Salary Review Process Guide Faculty Roles Administration Guide New Jersey Pay Transparency Act Forms and Data Submission Forms and Data Submission Submenu Appointment and Promotion Checklists List of Current Systems Helpful Tools Calendar of Major Actions and Important Dates News Benefits Apply FAQs iThenticate FAQs Search Search Home Academic Professionals Section Menu Incoming Academic Professionals Benefits for Academic Professionals Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement , (current page) Research for Academic Professionals Professional Development for Academic Professionals Checklist for Departure Link downloads document Information About Postdoc and Associate Research Scholar Unionization Postdoctoral Scholars Link is external Academic Professional Career Ranks & Advancement Princeton is more than a place to work. It’s a place to grow your career. Princeton creates clear pathways for advancement that facilitate opportunities for inspired thinkers who are changing what’s possible in teaching and research. While promotions are primarily managed by your department, the Office of the Dean of the Faculty is invested in your success and is here to serve as both a resource and guide throughout the process, whether you are just getting started here or planning your next step. Reappointment & Advancement To create clarity around the many opportunities open to you at Princeton, we maintain detailed information about University ranks and the advancement process. For complete details, visit Rules and Procedures of the Postdoctoral and Associate Research Scholar Ranks , Rules and Procedures of the Academic Professionals , and Rules and Procedures of the Professional Librarians . Professional Researcher Career Ladder (including Postdocs) Below are the research staff appointments in sequence. Please review Rules & Procedures for Professional Researchers and Professional Specialists, Chapter II & Chapter V Academic Research Manager Career Ladder Below are the academic research manager staff appointments in sequence. Please review Rules & Procedures for Professional Researchers and Professional Specialists, Chapter III Professional Specialist Career Ladder Below are the professional specialist staff appointments in sequence. Please review Rules & Procedures for Professional Researchers and Professional Specialists, Chapter IV . Professional Librarians Below are the professional librarian staff appointments in sequence. Please review Rules & Procedures for Professional Librarians, Chapter IV . Rules & Procedures Postdoctoral and Associate Research Scholar Ranks Academic Professionals Professional Librarians Policies Equal Opportunity Non-Discrimination Statement Footer Office of the Dean of the Faculty Princeton University 9 Nassau Hall, Princeton, NJ 08544-5264 Phone: 609-258-3020 Fax: 609-258-2168 Contact Us Give Feedback Discrimination/Harassment Complaint Form Link opens in new window Request Data Rules & Procedures of the Faculty Rights, Rules, Responsibilities Link is external University-Wide Policies Link is external Employer Obligation Regarding Records Link downloads document, Link opens in new window Workplace Notices Link is external Diversity & Non-Discrimination Link is external Accessibility Help Link is external © 2026 The Trustees of Princeton University m"
